  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n{自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\nPair: {狭|せば}める (transitive - to narrow something)\nPattern: Xが{狭|せば}まる\n\nRELATION TO {狭|せま}い:\n{狭|せば}まる is the verb form derived from {狭|せま}い (narrow). Note the consonant change: せま→せば.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{狭|せば}まっている - has narrowed (resultant state)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {視野|しや}が{狭|せば}まる - one's perspective narrows\n- {範囲|はんい}が{狭|せば}まる - the range narrows\n- {可能性|かのうせい}が{狭|せば}まる - possibilities narrow\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used metaphorically for options, possibilities, or scope being reduced.",
